 is on the side.

2135
01:18:14,380 --> 01:18:16,220
-[SCREAMING]

2136
01:18:16,220 --> 01:18:17,130
-Whoa, who?

2137
01:18:17,130 --> 01:18:18,010
-Whoa, look at that!

2138
01:18:18,010 --> 01:18:18,770
