2141
01:18:23,320 --> 01:18:24,940
-Call the police!

2142
01:18:24,940 --> 01:18:25,530
-Ray Bolger?

2143
01:18:25,530 --> 01:18:26,690
No!

2144
01:18:26,690 --> 01:18:28,140
-[BELCHING]

2145
