 giant, darling.

2149
01:18:38,510 --> 01:18:39,480
-[SPEAKING_CAVEMAN]

2150
01:18:39,480 --> 01:18:40,370
-Yes it is.

2151
01:18:40,370 --> 01:18:40,870
-Aw, come on.

2152
01:18:40,870 --> 01:18:42,010
You can talk plainer than that.

2153
01:18:42,010 --> 01:18:42,540
-I'm sorry, sir.

2154
01:18:42,540 --> 01:18:43,150
Take that outside.

2155
01:18:43,150 --> 01:18:43,840
-He's real.

2156
01:18:43,840 --> 01:18:45,090
-What did he say?

2157
01:18:45,090 --> 01:18:46,340
-He's real.

2158
01:18:46,340 --> 01:18:48,080
-Of course he-- he's real?

2159
01:18:48,080 --> 01:18:49,300
-[SCREAMING]

2160
