-Hey, the lifeguard
 saw you, you know.

2166
01:19:07,360 --> 01:19:11,620
-[LAUGHING]

2167
01:19:11,620 --> 01:19:12,570
-Adlai Stevenson!

2168
01:19:12,570 --> 01:19:13,610
-[HUMMING]

2169
01:19:13,610 --> 01:19:15,790
-Large man or giant
 creating disturbance.

2170
01:19:15,790 --> 01:19:17,910
Proceed with extreme caution.

2171
01:19:17,910 --> 01:19:19,370
-I have no idea why
 I started the car.

2172
01:19:19,370 --> 01:19:21,210
-The dumb blue line.

2173
01:19:21,210 --> 01:19:23,030
[MUSIC PLAYING]

2174
01:19:26,800 --> 01:19:30,010
