 that really swings show up?

2175
01:19:37,770 --> 01:19:38,890
-Ready, steady, bite me!

2176
01:19:44,270 --> 01:19:44,790
-Excuse me.

2177
01:19:44,790 --> 01:19:47,510
Thanks.

2178
01:19:47,510 --> 01:19:50,020
-I just wanted some
 fresh air, that's all.

2179
01:19:50,020 --> 01:19:50,830
-Is it, honey?

2180
01:19:50,830 --> 01:19:52,310
-Fresh, I mean.

2181
01:19:52,310 --> 01:19:53,880
-I'll go to the papers, daddy.

2182
01:19:53,880 --> 01:19:56,610
