-Aw, that's Dino's sax.

2240
01:21:42,880 --> 01:21:43,380
It leaks.

2241
01:21:47,600 --> 01:21:51,460
-It looks like "The Grifters"
 meets "Quest for Fire."

2242
01:21:51,460 --> 01:21:53,370
-[SCREAMING]

2243
01:21:53,370 --> 01:21:54,040
-Snoop Sisters.

2244
01:21:54,040 --> 01:21:54,930
Me hate 'em.

2245
01:21:54,930 --> 01:21:55,460
Mildred Natwick.

2246
01:21:55,460 --> 01:21:55,960
Bah.

2247
01:21:58,860 --> 01:22:00,320
-And hate George Gobel.

2248
01:22:00,320 --> 01:22:02,290
Ugh.

2249
01:22:02,290 --> 01:22:03,990
-Don't.

2250
01:22:03,990 --> 01:22:07,330
-Oh, boy, that was close.

2251
01:22:07,330 --> 01:22:10,590
-Hey, it's Wilma
 Flintstone's mom.

2252
01:22:10,590 --> 01:22:13,120
-Let's sneak
 another peek, Ethel.

2253
01:22:13,120 --> 01:22:14,160
-Hello, Mr. Giant?

2254
01:22:14,160 --> 01:22:16,290
Sir, with the stick upstairs.

2255
01:22:16,290 --> 01:22:16,860
Hel-hello?

2256
01:22:16,860 --> 01:22:17,360
Hello?

2257
01:22:17,360 --> 01:22:18,140
-Oh, crap.

2258
01:22:18,140 --> 01:22:19,840
My room's always
 by the ice machine.

2259
01:22:19,840 --> 01:22:20,340
Ugh.

2260
01:22:20,340 --> 01:22:30,680
[SIRENS]

2261
