2267
01:22:47,740 --> 01:22:48,240
-Hm?

2268
01:22:48,240 --> 01:22:51,790
Oh, the sheriff's
 barking out orders.

2269
01:22:51,790 --> 01:22:52,290
-Charlie!

2270
01:22:52,290 --> 01:22:53,310
Look out!

2271
01:22:53,310 --> 01:22:56,790
-You two are on your own.

2272
01:22:56,790 --> 01:22:57,720
-Bunny slippers?

2273
01:23:00,700 --> 01:23:01,920
-[SCREAMING]

2274
01:23:01,920 --> 01:23:05,090
-Oh, don't do that!

2275
01:23:05,090 --> 01:23:07,450
-Abner, I saw a giant!

2276
01:23:07,450 --> 01:23:08,180
-Don't shoot, Charlie.

2277
01:23:10,850 --> 01:23:12,230
[MUSIC PLAYING]

2278
01:23:12,230 --> 01:23:12,730
-Huh.

2279
01:23:12,730 --> 01:23:15,290
I guess she's working
 through her grief.

2280
01:23:15,290 --> 01:23:17,220
-(SINGING) Looky, looky,
 looky, look at my thorax.

2281
01:23:17,220 --> 01:23:21,240
Looky, looky, looky,
 look at my thorax.

2282
01:23:21,240 --> 01:23:24,290
Looky, looky, looky,
 look at my torso.

2283
01:23:27,270 --> 01:23:29,280
-Tequila.

2284
01:23:29,280 --> 01:23:30,820
-He walked out on his own song.

2285
01:23:37,180 --> 01:23:37,680
-Tequila.

2286
01:23:42,910 --> 01:23:46,230
-This band has more personnel
 changes than Menudo.

2287
01:23:46,230 --> 01:23:48,110
-It's a tag team band.

2288
01:23:54,140 --> 01:23:55,170
-Tequila.

2289
01:23:55,170 --> 01:23:55,670
Oops.

2290
01:24:01,590 --> 01:24:03,460
-If I didn't know
 they were dancing,

2291
01:24:03,460 --> 01:24:05,060
I'd swear this was a fight.

2292
01:24:05,060 --> 01:24:06,430
-What?

2293
01:24:06,430 --> 01:24:08,590
-I say, it looks like a fight.

2294
01:24:08,590 --> 01:24:10,440
-My boy is a good dancer.

2295
01:24:10,440 --> 01:24:11,600
-I'm bogarting
 that joint, Floyd.

2296
01:24:17,550 --> 01:24:18,710
-Where'd my date go?

2297
01:24:18,710 --> 01:24:20,680
Oh, there you are.

2298
01:24:24,120 --> 01:24:27,090
-(SINGING) My torso.

2299
01:24:27,090 --> 01:24:28,280
-Well, shall we?

2300
01:24:28,280 --> 01:24:28,850
-You asking?

2301
01:24:28,850 --> 01:24:30,540
-Come on, you clown.

2302
01:24:30,540 --> 01:24:32,220
-I'm with you, bud.

2303
01:24:34,970 --> 01:24:37,450
-(SINGING) Together
 forever and ever with--

2304
01:24:45,480 --> 01:24:46,130
-Wait a minute.

2305
01:24:46,130 --> 01:24:46,900
Something's wrong here.

2306
01:24:46,900 --> 01:24:47,880
Where's my girlfriend?

2307
01:24:50,450 --> 01:24:50,940
-Tequila.

2308
01:24:57,170 --> 01:24:57,670
-Tequila.

2309
01:25:01,770 --> 01:25:05,500
-Can I have my
 date back, please?

2310
01:25:05,500 --> 01:25:06,940
Thank you.

2311
01:25:06,940 --> 01:25:10,070
-[GRUNTING] Not as
 strong as I used to be.

2312
01:25:18,060 --> 01:25:19,610
-Tequila.

2313
01:25:19,610 --> 01:25:21,060
-I'm gonna get you!

2314
01:25:24,920 --> 01:25:26,380
-Hey, how come I
 don't get Foley?

2315
01:25:26,380 --> 01:25:26,880
-Knock it off!

2316
01:25:26,880 --> 01:25:28,520
She's my girl!

2317
01:25:28,520 --> 01:25:29,610
-I'm gonna smash--

2318
01:25:29,610 --> 01:25:30,110
-You!

2319
01:25:33,300 --> 01:25:36,540
-Hi, everybody.

2320
01:25:36,540 --> 01:25:38,430
-The Hat Squad.

2321
01:25:38,430 --> 01:25:39,430
-Party crashers!

2322
01:25:39,430 --> 01:25:42,920
[SHOUTS]

2323
01:25:42,920 --> 01:25:45,720
