 say where or when, actually.

2324
01:25:45,720 --> 01:25:46,720
I didn't get one.

2325
01:25:46,720 --> 01:25:49,480
Hope it's OK I crashed.

2326
01:25:49,480 --> 01:25:51,340
-Eegah!

2327
01:25:51,340 --> 01:25:52,010
Eegah!

2328
01:25:52,010 --> 01:25:56,280
-Ooh, it's looking like
 Altamata all over again.

2329
01:25:56,280 --> 01:25:57,240
-No!

2330
01:25:57,240 --> 01:25:58,210
Don't!

2331
01:25:58,210 --> 01:25:59,440
-Don't drink the last beer!

2332
01:25:59,440 --> 01:26:01,270
[SHOUTS]

2333
01:26:01,270 --> 01:26:02,680
-No!

2334
01:26:02,680 --> 01:26:03,630
No!

2335
01:26:03,630 --> 01:26:04,570
-[GRUNT]

2336
01:26:04,570 --> 01:26:05,990
-No!

2337
01:26:05,990 --> 01:26:07,000
-Just push him in the pool.

2338
01:26:07,000 --> 01:26:10,150
He's probably got
 tubes in his ears.

2339
01:26:10,150 --> 01:26:13,160
-Man, she gets picked up so
 much she should have a handle.

2340
01:26:13,160 --> 01:26:14,300
-[SCREAMING]

2341
01:26:14,300 --> 01:26:15,060
-There he is!

2342
01:26:15,060 --> 01:26:15,560
-Halt!

2343
01:26:15,560 --> 01:26:16,470
Halt or I'll fire!

2344
01:26:16,470 --> 01:26:17,560
