2345
01:26:17,560 --> 01:26:19,210
-[LAUGHING]

2346
01:26:19,210 --> 01:26:20,090
-[GUNSHOTS]

2347
01:26:20,090 --> 01:26:20,590
-No!

2348
01:26:20,590 --> 01:26:21,250
Don't shoot!

2349
01:26:21,250 --> 01:26:22,910
He doesn't understand!

2350
01:26:22,910 --> 01:26:23,620
-Oops.

2351
01:26:23,620 --> 01:26:24,120
Too late.

2352
01:26:24,120 --> 01:26:25,480
-Roxy!

2353
01:26:25,480 --> 01:26:26,820
-[ROAR]

2354
01:26:26,820 --> 01:26:28,250
-At your Lincoln Mercury dealer.

2355
01:26:28,250 --> 01:26:29,460
-[CRYING]

2356
01:26:29,460 --> 01:26:31,250
-We're all out of Chex Mix!

2357
01:26:31,250 --> 01:26:32,190
-Bummer.

2358
01:26:32,190 --> 01:26:34,060
[GUNSHOTS]

2359
01:26:34,060 --> 01:26:35,730
-That's a strange
 thing to wield.

2360
01:26:35,730 --> 01:26:39,320
[GUNSHOTS]

2361
01:26:39,320 --> 01:26:40,260
-Hey, mom!

2362
01:26:40,260 --> 01:26:44,710
Watch me, mom! [MIMICS
 BUBBLING] Watch me!

2363
01:26:44,710 --> 01:26:47,620
-Yeah, we're going to
 need a really big skimmer.

2364
01:26:47,620 --> 01:26:48,120
-Oopsie daisy.

2365
01:26:51,130 --> 01:26:52,720
-Ugh!

2366
01:26:52,720 --> 01:26:53,660
-He's an evil specter.

2367
01:26:57,420 --> 01:26:59,190
-So, how about that drink?

2368
01:26:59,190 --> 01:27:00,720
-Mood's gone, Floyd.

2369
01:27:00,720 --> 01:27:02,620
-Poor devil.

2370
01:27:02,620 --> 01:27:05,300
-He tampered in God's domain.

2371
01:27:05,300 --> 01:27:05,800
-Boy.

2372
01:27:05,800 --> 01:27:06,770
Ironic.

2373
01:27:06,770 --> 01:27:08,860
Bastard never saw an
 in ground pool before.

2374
01:27:15,240 --> 01:27:16,760
-Remember, I love you.

2375
01:27:16,760 --> 01:27:17,410
-Who said that?

2376
01:27:17,410 --> 01:27:18,200
-Where'd he come from?

2377
01:27:18,200 --> 01:27:19,300
-Is he real?

2378
01:27:19,300 --> 01:27:21,550
-Who is he?

2379
01:27:21,550 --> 01:27:22,380
-His tail.

2380
01:27:22,380 --> 01:27:23,090
-Yes, he was real.

2381
01:27:23,090 --> 01:27:24,590
-What's that?

2382
01:27:24,590 --> 01:27:26,650
