 Book of Genesis.

2383
01:27:26,650 --> 01:27:28,160
-By Phil Collins?

2384
01:27:28,160 --> 01:27:32,930
-There were giants in
 the earth in those days.

2385
01:27:32,930 --> 01:27:36,080
Chapter 4, verse 32.

2386
01:27:36,080 --> 01:27:37,720
-Oh, that's totally
 out of context.

2387
01:27:40,450 --> 01:27:40,950
-Hm.

2388
01:27:43,780 --> 01:27:45,210
-Oh.

2389
01:27:45,210 --> 01:27:45,930
-Ugh.

2390
01:27:45,930 --> 01:27:46,900
Ick.

2391
01:27:46,900 --> 01:27:49,810
-[COUGHING]

2392
01:27:49,810 --> 01:27:51,270
-Oh, gee.

